WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.760 line:73%
kW at kWh… pareho
lang ba 'yan?

c02
00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.880 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:12.320 line:73%
Ang kW ay power: gaano
kabilis gumamit ng kuryente.

c04
00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:17.640 line:73%
Ang kWh ay energy: gaano
karami ang nagamit.

c05
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:21.670 line:73%
Halimbawa, isang
100-watt na TV.

c06
00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.690 line:73%
Kapag binuksan
mo nang 10 oras,

c07
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:25.930 line:73%
1 kWh ang nagamit nito.

c08
00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:31.530 line:73%
Sa Meralco bill, kWh ang
basehan ng energy charges.

c09
00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:37.960 line:73%
Kaya bago mag-solar,
kilalanin pareho: kW at kWh.

cz1
00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:43.840 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.600 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
